  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_7425.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Aquest diumenge s&#39;han acabat les festes d&#39;estiu de Suera, amb la desfilada i concurs de disfresses infantils, que han guanyat el germanet i la germaneta vestits de cotxes de xoc. El premi individual ha sigut per a la petita Vega, vestida de fada. Tot en 90 fotos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesinfantilsfestesagostsuera14/img_7323.jpg\" alt=\"img_7323\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesinfantilsfestesagostsuera14/img_7324.jpg\" alt=\"img_7324\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesinfantilsfestesagostsuera14/img_7325.jpg\" alt=\"img_7325\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesinfantilsfestesagostsuera14/img_7326.jpg\" alt=\"img_7326\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesinfantilsfestesagostsuera14/img_7327.jpg\" alt=\"img_7327\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesinfantilsfestesagostsuera14/img_7328.jpg\" alt=\"img_7328\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesinfantilsfestesagostsuera14/img_7330.jpg\" alt=\"img_7330\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesinfantilsfestesagostsuera14/img_7331.jpg\" alt=\"img_7331\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesinfantilsfestesag